{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/3z0jvc","slideIndex":0,"text":"Hello, I’m Charith Kalhara. I’m a Computer Science student at IIT Sri Lanka, affiliated with the University of Westminster. I’m building my professional identity around software development and cloud engineering. I enjoy creating practical applications and understanding what it takes to deploy them reliably. The idea behind my personal brand is simple: I build useful software and work to make it dependable in the cloud.\n\nIn this presentation, I’ll share the technical areas I’m developing, one project that brings them together, and the direction I want to take next.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
