{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xqg19g","slideIndex":1,"text":"My technical experience covers application development and cloud delivery. I’ve worked with Laravel, PHP, Filament and MySQL to build web applications. For deployment, I’ve used Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, Docker, GitHub Actions and Linux. I’m also expanding my skills through a cloud-native lab that uses Kubernetes, Terraform and Ansible.\n\nA strength I bring to my technical work is connecting the application to the systems that support it. I’m interested in how software is built, how it is deployed, and how it can continue to run reliably. I’m still developing in each area, and I’m using practical projects to build stronger engineering fundamentals.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
