{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/akus7s","slideIndex":2,"text":"One project that brings these skills together is a cloud-based court case management system for debt recovery. It is a production web application designed to organize case records. I developed the application with Laravel, PHP and Filament. It runs on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, with the application and database on separate virtual machines connected through a private network. Docker and GitHub Actions support deployment. The system also generates Sinhala-language PDF reports.\n\nWorking on this project helped me think beyond whether a feature works locally. Access, infrastructure, deployment and the needs of users all affect whether a system is useful. It gave me experience connecting application development with cloud operations, and it strengthened my interest in building reliable services.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
