{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m5h05z","slideIndex":3,"text":"Looking ahead, I want to grow toward cloud and DevOps engineering. I plan to deepen my understanding of cloud infrastructure, deployment automation and service reliability through hands-on work. My cloud-native lab is one way I’m building experience in these areas.\n\nThe values I want to bring to this work are security, responsibility and continuous learning. In the case management project, security meant considering access and keeping the database on a private network. I’ve also contributed to writing about the ethical and governance questions around predictive AI in healthcare. That experience reinforced that technical work should be matched by care for the people affected by it.\n\nMy goal is to build cloud systems that are useful, secure and dependable. Thank you.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}